*GBS**: Acute onset, ascending weakness, areflexia. Self-limited with treatment.\n4. **Hereditary neuropathy with liability to pressure palsies (HNPP)**: PMP22 deletion (vs. duplication in CMT1A). Episodic focal neuropathies at compression sites.\n\n**Genetic Testing**: Order **PMP22 duplication analysis** first (highest yield for CMT1). If negative, proceed to CMT gene panel.',
