ould strongly recommend that you and your girlfriend meet with a genetic counselor together. They specialize in helping families navigate exactly these decisions. They will not tell you what to do — they will help you understand your options so you can make a decision that is right for your family. Would you like me to arrange that referral?\'\n\n**6. Normalize the emotional process**:\n\'Whatever you decide, there is no wrong answer. Take the time you need, talk it through together, and know that we are here to support you every step of the way.\'\n\n**Key principles**: Non-directive genetic counseling approach, accurate genetic education, challenging internalized stigma, presenting all reproductive options neutrally, referral to genetic counseling, supporting patient autonomy in deeply personal decisions.',
